{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bp3D704lZK1794806419.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外交部宣布，國家主席習近平本周四，將同俄羅斯總統普京、美國總統特朗普，在深圳舉行中俄美元首會晤。</p><p></p><p>美國白宮上周六亦已證實，特朗普本周訪華期間，會同中俄元首舉行歷來首次三方會談。</p><p></p><p>白宮指特朗普視這次會面為三國元首討論裁減核武協議的好機會，亦會談及美伊戰事，但不會觸及已持續逾四年半的俄烏戰事，亦未有安排美俄元首會談。</p><p></p><p>特朗普亦不會提及美國晶片公司輝達創辦人黃仁勳承認婚外情，掀起的間諜疑雲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:53:50.719425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T01:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:23.708682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:47:07.747512+00:00","content_hash":"6bd760c65e008a26a49ff3a7bcf1c2154d10bbedbdd96955ebe31d22da4eaaa4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:53:50.719425+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}